{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558800/extras/8947f5ca12082afa232101ad898da2e1.avif?t=1694162618\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>     Famous myth hunter <strong>Michael Soloman</strong>, while continuing his research and explorations, finds himself in a abandoned area named <strong>Grunenberg</strong> based on the information he has heard. This region, which has had one relatively unknown witch case, seems to hold significant potential for him. One day, Michael Soloman's grandson, <strong>Jimmy Soloman</strong>, receives a letter from his grandfather. In this letter, his grandfather urges Jimmy to come to <strong>Grunenberg</strong> immediately, bringing a camera with him and never turning it off. Although Jimmy isn't very close with his grandfather, he sets out for <strong>Grunenberg</strong> to find him and understand what is happening in that area.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2558800/extras/03f1d57f7374ff9439976dbebd0006a9.avif?t=1694162618\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br><br>    <strong>- Visuals and audio design reminiscent of VHS cassette tapes,</strong><br>    <strong>- An unsettling and claustrophobic atmosphere instead of cheap horror,</strong><br>    <strong>- Blending immersive progression with puzzles,</strong><br>    <strong>-Interludes and a plethora of discoverable story content,</strong><br>    <strong>-Dynamic enemy AI that tracks your movements,</strong><br>    <strong>-Light and flashlight mechanics affected by the enemy,</strong>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2558800?t=1694162618","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2558800?t=1694162618","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/255880